<@include gpu/Config.slh@>
<$VERSION_HEADER$>
//  <$_SCRIBE_FILENAME$>
//  Generated on <$_SCRIBE_DATE$>
//
//  An impostor card (ImpostorCard, IMPOSTORS.md 2.3): a square of side two radii through the subject's centre, turned
//  to face the camera by its model transform; four corners from a shared buffer, drawn as a triangle strip. The
//  fragment shader does the rest from the world position: which of the six frames face the camera, where this pixel's
//  ray meets the baked surface, and the depth it writes.
